# Adventurer honors content split

## Edit here

- Honor requirements and answers: `app/adventurer-honors/content/{category}/*.md`
- Authoring conventions: `app/adventurer-honors/AUTHORING.md`
- Frontmatter + body shape: `lib/markdown/samples/authoring-sample.md`

## Do not put honor prose in TypeScript

- Never add/update `requirements`, answer paragraphs, or teaching tips in `.ts` / `.tsx`
- `.ts` is for types, loaders, serializers, search/sort, and markdown rendering only

## Body conventions (required)

```markdown
## 要求
1. …

## 答案
榮譽證目的：…

### 要求 1
…
```

## Frontmatter (structured, keep small)

Required: `id`, `code`, `nameZh`, `category`, `answerSource`, `status`  
Optional: `nameEn`, `aliases`, `answerSourceNote`  
Enums: `answerSource` = `translated` | `draft`; `status` = `non-review` | `reviewed`

## Bulk edits

Use scripts that read/write markdown via `lib/data/serialize.ts` — do not revive `honors-data.ts`.
